{
  "name": "timesheet",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "intent": "スタッフの勤怠を提出し、派遣先の承認を経てから請求と給与に回す",
  "tags": [
    "timesheet",
    "attendance",
    "勤怠",
    "タイムシート",
    "勤怠承認",
    "派遣先",
    "残業",
    "36協定"
  ],
  "slots": {
    "entity": {
      "type": "entity",
      "required": true,
      "desc": "勤怠エンティティ"
    },
    "approver": {
      "type": "role",
      "required": true,
      "desc": "派遣先の承認ロール。無い勤怠は請求に回せない"
    },
    "on_approved": {
      "type": "hook",
      "required": false,
      "desc": "派遣先の承認後に呼ぶ処理（請求起票など）"
    },
    "period": {
      "type": "enum",
      "values": ["daily", "monthly"],
      "required": false,
      "desc": "daily または monthly。既定は monthly"
    },
    "overtime_cap_hours": {
      "type": "duration",
      "required": false,
      "desc": "36協定で定めた時間外の上限（時間）。法定の数値は入れない"
    }
  },
  "states": ["draft", "submitted", "client_approved", "returned"],
  "transitions": [
    {"from": "draft", "on": "submit", "to": "submitted", "effect": "notify(approver)"},
    {"from": "submitted", "on": "approve", "to": "client_approved", "effect": "emit(audit)"},
    {"from": "submitted", "on": "return", "to": "returned", "effect": "notify(staff)"},
    {"from": "returned", "on": "resubmit", "to": "submitted"}
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "on_approved": {"kind": "custom_or_pattern", "required": false}
  },
  "requires_fields": {"status": "String"},
  "field_types": {
    "work_date": "Date",
    "hours": "Duration"
  },
  "constraints": [
    {
      "id": "overtime_cap_non_negative",
      "left": "overtime_cap_hours",
      "op": ">=",
      "right": "0",
      "kind": "duration",
      "message": "overtime cap must be zero or a positive number of hours",
      "note": "このスロットは会社の36協定の設定値。法定の45時間は overtime_agreement の既定と上限であり、このスロットには埋め込まない。月次で45を超える値は、有効な特別条項が無いとエラー。実労働時間との比較は実行時。"
    }
  ],
  "effects": ["read(timesheets)", "write(timesheets)", "notify(approver)", "emit(audit)"],
  "artifacts": [
    {"path": "db/schema.sql#timesheets", "kind": "SQL", "lines": 22, "desc": "勤怠、日次明細、承認ステップ"},
    {"path": "api/timesheets/route.ts", "kind": "API", "lines": 70, "desc": "勤怠の提出と一覧"},
    {"path": "api/timesheets/[id]/route.ts", "kind": "API", "lines": 60, "desc": "派遣先の承認と差し戻し"},
    {"path": "app/(client)/timesheets/page.tsx", "kind": "UI", "lines": 80, "desc": "派遣先の承認画面"},
    {"path": "app/(staff)/timesheets/page.tsx", "kind": "UI", "lines": 75, "desc": "スタッフの入力画面"},
    {"path": "lib/workflows/timesheet.ts", "kind": "TS", "lines": 65, "desc": "状態遷移、時間外上限、承認後フック"},
    {"path": "tests/timesheets.test.ts", "kind": "TEST", "lines": 70, "desc": "提出、承認、上限のテスト"}
  ],
  "examples": ["examples/staffing.prout", "examples/staffing_desk.prout"],
  "notes": [
    "派遣先承認は approver スロットを必須にすることで、承認のない勤怠パターンをコンパイルエラーにする。",
    "時間外のある勤怠（overtime_hours フィールド、または正の overtime_cap_hours）には overtime_agreement が要る。法定の45時間・360時間はそのパターンの既定と上限。",
    "overtime_cap_hours は協定書の値。日次の cap は月45時間とは比べない。",
    "承認そのものの画面遷移は approval パターンと同じ形だが、対象が勤怠で承認者が派遣先である点が違う。"
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "author": "PROUT staffing prototype",
    "date": "2026-11-21",
    "extracted_from": ["staffing", "staffing_desk"],
    "note": "人材派遣の勤怠提出と派遣先承認。法定時間は設定値として受け取る。"
  }
}
